      "start_ms": 359600,
      "end_ms": 360940,
      "text": "强将手下吴若冰，",
      "token_start": 1630,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1637
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 361220,
      "end_ms": 362665,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？",
      "token_start": 1637,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1646
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 362920,
      "end_ms": 364260,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，",
      "token_start": 1646,
      "token_end_exclusive": 1655
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 364320,
      "end_ms": 366165,
      "text": "这个真是让我一解心开啊。",
